          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A decline in cohesion among states supporting Ukraine reduces shared diplomatic bandwidth, unity of messaging and willingness to lead crisis management, causing a drop in coordinated diplomatic engagement in the Gulf theatre." />
