          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising perceptions that negotiated commitments can be flouted (from Russian violations) lead policymakers to explicitly reframe economic instruments as national‑security tools (e.g., tighter investment screening, industrial subsidies justified on security grounds) targeted at strategic competitors including China." />
