          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A surge in high‑level diplomatic engagement focused on de‑escalation in the Iran–Gulf theatre absorbs mediators' time and political bandwidth in Washington and Brussels, reducing the tempo and intensity of parallel negotiation and mediation efforts directed at the Russia–Ukraine conflict." />
