          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Surging attacks and interdictions on shipping prompt carriers and ports to rapidly reroute, onboard alternate third‑party logistics providers and adopt new tracking/coordination platforms, increasing the density and permeability of technical and organizational links across domains." />
