          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in hostile maritime incidents in the Gulf compels the US, UK and regional partners to reposition naval forces and escalate maritime signalling, which sharpens great‑power security competition dynamics and increases strategic pressure and contestation that spill into the Ukraine theatre." />
