          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A spike in Gulf maritime incidents prompts US policy makers to tighten export controls and broaden end‑use/end‑user restrictions (and press allies to align) to prevent technologies transiting insecure sea lanes from being diverted to Chinese military or dual‑use programs." />
          <attvalue for="37" value="0-6 months" />
