          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rapid increase in installed AI compute (GPUs/TPUs) expands attacker access to high-throughput training/inference resources (via compromised cloud accounts, stolen credits, or affordable rentals), enabling automated exploit discovery, large‑scale phishing personalization, and faster brute‑force/ML-powered attacks that raise the rate of successful intrusions." />
